## SQ-CDFW-01 | CD framework counts at boot
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -n "\[cans\]\|\[food types\]\|\[placeable\]\|\[can servings\]\|\[mortar\]\|genPut\|genMerge" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| head -20`; `grep -n "Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log \| head`
@pass `[cans] registered 276 generated cans`; `[food types] ... in 31 types`; `[placeable]` counts; `[can servings] 313 cans` (less any whose mod is absent); `[mortar] 6 of 6 catalog crafts`; no "no ... member scripts loaded" error
@fails a member script did not load: check its `// requires:` mod id and that the jar loader honours `requires`; rerun `tools/test_gen_members.py`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
bootexpect \[cans\] registered \d+ generated cans
bootexpect \[food types\] \d+ foods in 31 types
bootexpect \[placeable\]
bootexpect \[can servings\] 31\d cans
bootexpect \[mortar\] 6 of 6 catalog crafts
bootreject (?i)no .* member scripts loaded
shell grep -hn "\[cans\]\|\[food types\]\|\[placeable\]\|\[can servings\]\|\[mortar\]\|genPut\|genMerge" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | head -20; true
look [can servings] is 313 less cans of absent mods (rows/SQ-CDFW-01.shell.txt); a different [cans] count after a later generator run is not a fail by itself

## SQ-CDFW-02 | food type, canned source and servings tags unchanged
@group A
@commands `/dumptags item`; compare `creativeengineering:food_type/*`, `creativeengineering:canned_source`, `creativeengineering:cans/servings/*` sizes with `python3 tools/test_gen_members.py` (46 tags, 2724 entries)
@pass same members as before the change (sizes equal to the last dump less items of absent mods)
@fails genMerge lost a part: compare the merged data with the JSON records
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> dumptags item
waitlog \[dumptags\] wrote 600
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py tagdiff $INST/kubejs/exported creativeengineering:food_type creativeengineering:canned_source creativeengineering:cans/servings
look sizes equal to the 10-30 instance dump except items of absent mods and the 11-01 additions (test_gen_members.py: 46 tags, 2724 entries offline)

